  "label": "DERIVED_FROM_SOURCE",
  "statement": "cand_X = min(n[SX], free) and n[SX] <= S0, so ONE organiser cell can convert at most S0 resource units per step. The body cloud it maintains therefore obeys the exact bound N_X <= S0/muX, and N_X = 0 is an absorbing state because every birth probability carries the factor nX*nY.",
