  "N_X_hard_cap_at_the_frozen_MINCORE_point": 600.0,
  "consequence": "a body cloud of a few tens of molecules around a single organiser is a small population next to an absorbing state. Neither Kamimura and Kaneko, whose molecules are conserved and held by an attractive potential, nor the MTW01 preplan, which gated the cloud only at one instant, contains this condition.",
  "required_form_of_the_missing_gate": "muX <= S0/N_ROBUST for a declared robust cloud size N_ROBUST, evaluated jointly with ell_X = sqrt(D_X/muX) and with the two Kamimura-Kaneko timescale inequalities"
 },
